        {"zh": "我的伴侣在黑暗中等待。", "en": "My mate waits in darkness."},
        {"zh": "用触手表达爱意。", "en": "Express love with my tentacles."},
        {"zh": "我的触手能感受到对方。", "en": "My tentacles sense my mate."},
        {"zh": "我的伴侣在沼泽深处。", "en": "My mate is deep in the mire."},
        {"zh": "用触手拥抱我的伴侣。", "en": "Embrace my mate with tentacles."},
        {"zh": "我的触手渴望拥抱。", "en": "My tentacles crave embrace."},
        {"zh": "我的触手能感受到彼此。", "en": "My tentacles sense each other."},
        {"zh": "我的伴侣也在黑暗中。", "en": "My mate is also in the dark."},
        {"zh": "用触手触碰我的伴侣。", "en": "Touch my mate with tentacles."}
